# Detected Windows Software Discovery | T1518 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_reg_software_discovery.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 Image="*\\reg.exe" CommandLine="*query*" CommandLine="*\\software\\*" CommandLine="*/v*" CommandLine="*svcversion*"
